


HYPOT(3M)           UNIX Programmer's Manual            HYPOT(3M)



NAME
     hypot, cabs - Euclidean distance

SYNOPSIS
     #include <math.h>

     double hypot(x, y)
     double x, y;

     double cabs(z)
     struct { double x, y;} z;

DESCRIPTION
     _H_y_p_o_t and _c_a_b_s return

          sqrt(x*x + y*y),

     taking precautions against unwarranted overflows.

SEE ALSO
     exp(3) for _s_q_r_t


































